    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d329">

                <pb facs="0484" n="380" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg380"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 837.156/146.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Minister to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Habana</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-06-23">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 23, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The President of Cuba advises me that in conformity with the views of the Cabinet
                    he will soon send a message to Congress recommending repeal of the law of
                    December 21, 1910. He adds that our views regarding the bridge matter are shared
                    by the present Government of Cuba.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Beaupré</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
